   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Soft blue matte: lifted blacks (p1 ~45, the softest of the set), median ~100, compressed highlights (p99 ~198), cool blue shadows (41,49,60), blue bin 62%, saturation 0.29. Best for: Intimate scenes: mist, forest detail, soft dawn, overcast coast, quiet minimal frames, gentle couple portraits in nature. Matte film feel - no hard blacks or whites.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
